# Debug-only fictional data, visibly labelled. No account or transaction capabilities.
fold folded
launch dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity
expect "Today's issue"
expect Search markets
shot hunch-live-cover
# Repeatable fixture exercises details without live market churn.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es fixture demo
expect FICTIONAL MARKET DEMO · NO REAL MONEY
expect Paper Cranes
shot hunch-demo-cover
# Match card title (not the filter).
tap Paper Cranes vs Ink Foxes
# The sheet: both sides, the stake, read-only. The demo's one ask expires, so a side may show either price or no quote.
expect Foxes — NO VERIFIED QUOTE
expect PUT IN
scrollto READ ONLY · REFRESH
scrollto Resolution Deadline
expect HOW IT SETTLES
shot hunch-detail-cover
key BACK
expect "Today's issue"
tap Prices
expect DEMO above 100?
tap DEMO above 100?
expect Yes — NO VERIFIED QUOTE
expect No — NO VERIFIED QUOTE
expect No verified executable quote.
shot hunch-empty-book
key BACK
tap Bets
expect No trading account is connected.
tap Money
expect Open your wallet to view verified balances.
shot hunch-money-empty
tap Today
tap All
fold open
rotate portrait
# Upright v6: cover-style full pages, enlarged, with pinned bottom chapter tabs.
expect HUNCH
expect Search markets
expect GUT CHECK
expect TODAY
expect BETS
expect MONEY
absent "Today's issue"
# LOOK: page fills full width/height; tabs pinned at bottom, no blank right/bottom strips.
shot hunch-v6-upright-today
tap Paper Cranes vs Ink Foxes
expect BACK
shot hunch-v6-upright-detail
key BACK
expect Search markets
tap Bets
expect TRADING NOT CONNECTED
shot hunch-v6-upright-bets
tap Money
expect Trading cash is not connected.
shot hunch-v6-upright-money
tap Today
expect Search markets
rotate landscape
expect HUNCH
expect Search markets
expect TRADING NOT CONNECTED
shot hunch-two-pane-landscape
# LOOK: only the left half moves. No page scroll; right side and title remain fixed.
swipe 0.24 0.82 0.24 0.30 500
shot hunch-two-pane-landscape-left-scroll
swipe 0.24 0.30 0.24 0.82 500
tap Paper Cranes vs Ink Foxes
expect MY BETS
shot hunch-two-pane-landscape-detail
# LOOK: scroll only detail pane to its read-only action and settlement rules.
swipe 0.75 0.84 0.75 0.30 500
scrollto READ ONLY · REFRESH
expect Opening the order ticket sends nothing
swipe 0.5 0.35 0.5 0.8
scrollto REVIEW AN ORDER
tap REVIEW AN ORDER
expect FICTIONAL TEST ORDER
scrollto Back to market
tap Back to market
expect HUNCH
expect HOW IT SETTLES
shot hunch-two-pane-landscape-detail-scrolled
scrollto Resolution Deadline
shot hunch-two-pane-landscape-rules
# Sticky pane back control returns to bets and leaves the market list in place.
tap MY BETS
expect TRADING NOT CONNECTED
shot hunch-two-pane-landscape-back
rotate portrait
expect HUNCH
expect Search markets
expect BETS
expect MONEY
shot hunch-v6-upright-restored
# HTTP error fixture cannot fall back to unlabelled stale data.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es fixture error
# A cold start can sit on the splash past expect's 8 s on a loaded Mac.
wait 5000
expect OFFLINE TEST · NO REAL MONEY
expect Markets could not be loaded.
absent Loading listings
absent 1 OF 0
absent OPEN →
# LOOK: offline copy replaces loading; both independent panes fit the inner height.
shot hunch-offline
# Leave live read-only app, never the fixture, for a human.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity
expect Search markets
[phone] Verify live market names, search, side selection, empty/one-sided book labels and refresh on the Fold. Open wallet from the inner bets pane and return. Do not confirm a live order during a walk; the owner alone funds and signs. Check actual fold/rotation, independent landscape pane scrolling, upright full pages with pinned bottom tabs, cover unchanged and Back retaining the market query.
